  "title": "OR Royalties Declares 18% Increase to Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "Download in pdf MONTREAL, May 06, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — OR Royalties Inc. (the “Company” or “OR Royalties”) (OR: TSX & NYSE) is pleased to announce that its Board of Directors has approved a second quarter 2026 dividend of US$0.065 per common share, an 18.2% increase over the previous quarterly dividend. The dividend will […]",
